3. Post can accept it all. Also amount in cents should be numberic and not string.
   If we send without cents we get an int error
   "message": "validation error:\n - amount_cents: value must be greater than 0 [int64.gt]",

For string
{
"code": 3,
"message": "proto: (line 5:18): invalid value for int64 type: \"hello\"",
"details": []
}

In Documentation is
{
"title": "string",
"description": "string",
"claimantId": "string",
"amountCents": "string",
"currency": "string"
}

and no specificaiton for mandatory fields

